  characterName: Chico Santos
  promptText: Loggers are after the rare medicinal trees we heal with. Photographing
    their destruction could help protect our forest medicine, but it would make my
    family a target. Do I expose them, or stay silent to keep my loved ones safe?
  leftAnswer: Yes, document and expose the damage; this knowledge must be saved.
  rightAnswer: No, protect your family now and gather strength quietly.
